---

<div class="ad-layer" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="ad-ticker">
    <div class="ad-ticker-track">
      <span>★ 恭喜您成为本站幸运访客 ★ 点击即可领取大奖 ★ 名额有限 先到先得 ★</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true"
        >★ 恭喜您成为本站幸运访客 ★ 点击即可领取大奖 ★ 名额有限 先到先得 ★</span
      >
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ad-wall">
    <div class="ad-slab"><span>是兄弟就来砍我</span><span>一刀 999</span><span>点击就送</span></div>
    <div class="ad-slab">
      <span>屠龙宝刀</span><span>上线即送</span><span>装备全靠打</span><span>沙巴克等你</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ad-slab">
      <span>同城交友</span><span>附近的人想认识你</span><span>免费畅聊</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ad-slab"><span>免费下载</span><span>立即体验</span><span>名额有限</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="ad-sky">
    <span>限时</span>
    <span>福利</span>
    <span>点击</span>
    <span>领取</span>
  </div>

  <div class="ad-player">
    <div class="ad-player-screen"><span class="ad-player-play">▶</span></div>
    <div class="ad-player-label">点击播放</div>
  </div>

  <div class="ad-date">
    <span class="ad-date-title">同城交友</span>
    <span class="ad-date-sub">附近 3km 有人想认识你</span>
    <button class="ad-date-cta" type="button" tabindex="-1">立即聊天</button>
  </div>

  <div class="ad-legends">
    <div class="ad-dialog-bar">
      <span>热血传奇 · 今日新区</span>
      <button class="ad-dialog-x" type="button" tabindex="-1" data-ad-close>×</button>
    </div>
    <div class="ad-legends-body">
      <p class="ad-legends-title">是兄弟就来砍我</p>
      <p class="ad-legends-sub">上线即送屠龙宝刀 · 一刀 999</p>
      <button class="ad-legends-cta" type="button" tabindex="-1">点击进入</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ad-dialog">
    <div class="ad-dialog-bar">
      <span>系统安全提示</span>
      <button class="ad-dialog-x" type="button" tabindex="-1" data-ad-close>×</button>
    </div>
    <div class="ad-dialog-body">
      <p>检测到您的设备存在风险，请立即处理！</p>
      <button class="ad-dialog-cta" type="button" tabindex="-1">一键修复</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ad-modal">
    <div class="ad-modal-box">
      <div class="ad-modal-title">★ 恭喜中奖 ★</div>
      <p class="ad-modal-text">您已被随机抽中一等奖，请立即领取。</p>
      <button class="ad-modal-cta" type="button" tabindex="-1">立即领取</button>
      <button class="ad-modal-x" type="button" tabindex="-1" data-ad-close>关闭</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  (function adLayerClose() {
    const root = document.querySelector('.ad-layer');
    if (!root) return;

    root.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
      const target = event.target;
      if (!(target instanceof Element)) return;
      const close = target.closest('[data-ad-close]');
      if (!close) return;
      const pop = close.closest('.ad-dialog, .ad-legends, .ad-modal-box');
      if (!pop) return;
      pop.classList.add('is-dismissed');
      window.setTimeout(() => pop.classList.remove('is-dismissed'), 1600);
    });
  })();
</script>
